      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "TP 竖切：三条红竖线各在\nshard 内 50%（q: 8+8，k/v: 4+4）\n\nrank0 = 三段左半（蓝）拼接\n          [1024, 2048]\nrank1 = 三段右半（橙）\n\n⇒ 融合矩阵不是中间一刀！\nweight_loader 按 shard_id\n分别装填各段",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 416896238,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "TP 竖切：三条红竖线各在\nshard 内 50%（q: 8+8，k/v: 4+4）\n\nrank0 = 三段左半（蓝）拼接\n          [1024, 2048]\nrank1 = 三段右半（橙）\n\n⇒ 融合矩阵不是中间一刀！\nweight_loader 按 shard_id\n分别装填各段",
      "textAlign": "left",
