      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "y0 + y1 = (X0 @ W0) + (X1 @ W1) = X @ W —— 矩阵乘线性性：先投影再相加 ≡ 先拼接再投影；每层 2 次 all_reduce（o_proj + down_proj）",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1869038936,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
