    {
      "id": "mvnriwks7hi3mo22cc3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 942,
      "y": 1095,
      "width": 210,
      "height": 158,
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "boundElements": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "b2D",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "V 只读！信息不是嵌入 V，\n而是每个 token 按自己的\n权重行抽取全体 V\n\nweights 第 i 行 = 取料配比\nK = 标签（被检索）\nV = 内容（被抽取）\n\ndecode：新 token 1 行 Q →\n打分 → 权重行 → 抽取\n整个 KV 池的 V",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1114623494,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "V 只读！信息不是嵌入 V，\n而是每个 token 按自己的\n权重行抽取全体 V\n\nweights 第 i 行 = 取料配比\nK = 标签（被检索）\nV = 内容（被抽取）\n\ndecode：新 token 1 行 Q →\n打分 → 权重行 → 抽取\n整个 KV 池的 V",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1792928816242,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1971684112,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
